        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> An Ice Block and a Berry Preserve (Cooking tab); makes two bowls.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Eat it to cool down: a little food and water, and a Cooled status that makes the weather feel milder for a few hours (all values are tunable placeholders). It melts away in about 6 hours, so eat it at once."
    },
